# DES Y6-like CL+GC / CL+3x2pt synthetic data set (arXiv 2503.13631): the
# base descriptor. The likelihoods load des_cluster_y6_4x2ptN.dataset (CL+GC)
# and des_cluster_y6_6x2ptN.dataset (CL+3x2pt), which read every key from
# this file (DEFAULT) and set the mask_file of their combination.
# data_file, cov_file: the joint data vector (2812 entries; the model at the
# fiducial point of Table I, without noise) and its analytic Gaussian
# covariance, both written by scripts/make_synthetic_data.py.
# mask_file: scripts/make_cluster_mask.py writes one scale-cut mask per
#   combination: des_cluster_y6_4x2ptN.mask (CL+GC) and
#   des_cluster_y6_6x2ptN.mask (CL+3x2pt). The key below names the CL+3x2pt
#   mask, so this file loaded on its own is the CL+3x2pt data set.
# n(z): Z_LOW z column (photoz_zmid_convention = 0); the cluster table
# des_y6_cluster.nz holds <phi_i|z> sampled at z (no half-cell offset).
# survey_area_deg2: 4143 = Y3 cluster footprint (arXiv 2503.13632); the local
# lighthouse Y6 configuration (dataY6.yaml) uses 4125.3.
data_file = des_cluster_y6.datavector
cov_file = des_cluster_y6.cov
mask_file = des_cluster_y6_6x2ptN.mask
nz_lens_file = des_y6_maglim.nz
nz_source_file = des_y6_source.nz
lens_ntomo = 6
source_ntomo = 4
n_theta = 20
theta_min_arcmin = 2.5
theta_max_arcmin = 250.0
nz_cluster_file = des_y6_cluster.nz
cluster_ntomo = 3
cluster_zbin_edges = 0.2,0.4,0.55,0.65
richness_edges = 20,30,45,60,500
survey_area_deg2 = 4143
cg_lens_bins = 0,1,2
baryon_pca_file = pca.txt
all_sims_hdf5_file = baryons_logPkR.h5
